  "faqsTitle": "FAQs",
  "whatIsLadyMeetups": "What is Lady Meetups?",
  "whatIsLadyMeetupsAnswer": "Lady Meetups is a community-driven platform designed to connect women in Riyadh through curated gatherings. Our mobile app facilitates seamless registration, personalized group formations, and event management, making it easier for women to build meaningful connections.",
  "howToSignUp": "How do I sign up for the app?",
  "howToSignUpAnswer": "Download the Lady Meetups app from the App Store or Google Play. Upon opening the app, you'll be guided through a one-time registration process where you'll provide basic information such as your name, contact details, and preferences.",
  "howToRegisterMeetup": "How do I register for a meetup?",
  "howToRegisterMeetupAnswer": "After completing your profile, you can browse upcoming events within the app. To register for a specific meetup, simply select the event and answer a few quick questions regarding your language preferences. This minimal input helps us tailor the experience to your needs.",
  "howGroupsFormed": "How are groups formed for the meetups?",
  "howGroupsFormedAnswer": "We carefully curate groups of 5–6 women based on shared interests, preferred language, duration of stay in Riyadh, motherhood status, and age group. This ensures a comfortable and relatable experience for all participants.",
  "whenReceiveMeetupDetails": "When and how will I receive the meetup details?",
  "whenReceiveMeetupDetailsAnswer": "Once your group is formed, we'll reserve a table at a handpicked venue in Riyadh. You'll receive the exact location and other pertinent details one day before the meetup via app notifications and email.",
  "paymentMethodsAccepted": "What payment methods are accepted?",
  "paymentMethodsAcceptedAnswer": "Our app supports secure payments through Apple Pay and major credit/debit cards. This provides a convenient and safe way to complete your registration.",
  "howStayUpdated": "How can I stay updated on upcoming events?",
  "howStayUpdatedAnswer": "Stay informed by:\\n• Enabling push notifications within the app.\\n• Joining our WhatsApp community for real-time updates.\\n• Following us on Instagram: @ladymeetups.",
  "meetupsOutsideRiyadh": "Are there any meetups outside Riyadh?",
  "meetupsOutsideRiyadhAnswer": "Currently, our events are held in Riyadh. We're exploring opportunities to expand to other cities in the future.",
  "suggestIdeas": "Can I suggest ideas or activities for future meetups?",
  "suggestIdeasAnswer": "Absolutely! We welcome your suggestions and ideas. Feel free to share them with us through the app's feedback section or via our social media channels.",
  
