  "faqWhatIsLadyMeetups": "What is Lady Meetups?",
  "faqWhatIsLadyMeetupsAnswer": "Lady Meetups is a community-driven platform designed to connect women through small, curated dinner gatherings. Using our mobile app, women can register, get matched into personalized groups, and join weekly meetups to build genuine friendships—wherever they live.",
  "faqHowToSignUp": "How do I sign up for the app?",
  "faqHowToSignUpAnswer": "Download the Lady Meetups app from the App Store or Google Play. You'll be guided through a quick one-time sign-up where you'll share basic details like your name, preferences, and interests to personalize your experience.",
  "faqHowToRegister": "How do I register for a meetup?",
  "faqHowToRegisterAnswer": "Once you've set up your profile, you'll see a list of available meetups in your city right inside the app. To join one, simply answer a few quick questions about your language, budget, and dietary preferences — this helps us match you with the right group. After you complete the payment, your spot is confirmed. You'll receive the venue details (name and location) via app notification 24 hours before the meetup.",
  "faqGroupFormation": "How are groups formed for the meetups?",
  "faqGroupFormationAnswer": "We match you with 5–6 like-minded women based on shared interests, age, language, and motherhood status. This creates a relaxed and relatable setting where real connections can grow.",
  
