  "faqMeetupDetails": "When and how will I receive the meetup details?",
  "faqMeetupDetailsAnswer": "After your group is finalized, we'll book a table at a handpicked venue in your city. You'll receive the location and event details the night before your meetup via app notifications.",
  "faqPaymentMethods": "What payment methods are accepted?",
  "faqPaymentMethodsAnswer": "We accept secure payments through Apple Pay, Google Pay, and all major credit/debit cards—all processed safely within the app.",
  "faqStayUpdated": "How can I stay updated on upcoming events?",
  "faqStayUpdatedAnswer": "You can stay in the loop by:\n• Enabling push notifications in the app\n• Joining our WhatsApp community for real-time updates\n• Following us on Instagram: @ladymeetups",
  "faqCities": "Which cities is Lady Meetups available in?",
  "faqCitiesAnswer": "We're currently active in select cities and expanding rapidly. Currently in London, Berlin, Dubai, Dublin, Riyadh, Jeddah, and more. If we're not in your city yet, you can still sign up to be notified when we launch near you.",
  "faqSuggestions": "Can I suggest ideas or activities for future meetups?",
  "faqSuggestionsAnswer": "Absolutely! We welcome your suggestions and ideas. Feel free to share them with us through the app's feedback section or via our social media channels.",
